<title>HONG KONG: HK's Shanghai Commercial Bank places FRCD.</title>
<headline>HK's Shanghai Commercial Bank places FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Commercial Bank's HK$600 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue will be completed as a private placement, bankers said on Friday.</p>
<p>The facility has a final maturity of five years with a put and a call option in year three.</p>
<p>The issue pays a coupon of 35 basis points over the three-month Hong Kong Interbank Offered rate.</p>
<p>With fees, the all-in return for top-tier managers is 43 basis points.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
